Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么办法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来教教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好好地给我看着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,弄湿我
