Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.58,1:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不要拿掉哦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.68,1:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,老实一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.53,1:20:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好好享受哦
